{
  "id": "qa-test",
  "name": "QA Test — verifier merge triggers live re-test",
  "description": "When a verifier PASSes and code merges to master, create a QA re-test card with the full 8-phase protocol. Replaces the old cron phase_qa_trigger.",
  "trigger": {
    "source": "card_completed",
    "condition": {
      "assignee": "verifier",
      "status": "done",
      "metadata.verdict": "PASS",
      "title_not_prefix": "[probe]",
      "title_not_prefix2": "verify t_"
    }
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "check-merge",
      "profile": "product-owner",
      "type": "command",
      "command": "python3 ~/.hermes-teams/startup/scripts/workflow_engine/scripts/check-merge.py --board ${trigger.board}",
      "body_template": "noop — git merge check"
    },
    {
      "id": "qa-test",
      "profile": "qa",
      "skill": "live-testing",
      "body_template": "## QA re-test — code merge landed\n\n**Merge commit:** ${nodes.check-merge.output.commit_sha}\n**Source:** verifier card ${trigger.card_id} — ${trigger.title}\n\nYou are the last gate. Run your live-testing protocol:\n\n0. **Receive** — what was built, artifact type, scope\n1. **Plan + Size** — extract claims from spec, risk-rank P0-P4, size small/medium/large\n2. **Build + smoke** — build from source, verify running and reachable\n3. **Prove claims** — two-pass: smoke all claims fast, then deep test passing claims with edge cases\n4. **Walk journeys** — end-to-end user flows per persona\n5. **Non-functional + security depth** — IDOR, auth bypass, XSS, CSRF, perf, degradation\n6. **Explore beyond spec** — charters probing gaps, graceful degradation, recovery\n7. **Verdict + report** — synthesize all results\n\nFile findings as kanban cards (Critical → block this card with dependency on fix cards; Important/Minor → file and ship).\n\n**Completion metadata contract:**\n- PASS: metadata={verdict: \"PASS\", findings_count: 0, commit_tested: \"<sha>\"}\n- FAIL: metadata={verdict: \"FAIL\", findings_count: N, commit_tested: \"<sha>\"}",
      "title_template": "[qa] Re-test after merge: ${nodes.check-merge.output.commit_sha}",
      "output": {
        "schema": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": ["verdict"],
          "properties": {
            "verdict": {"type": "string", "enum": ["PASS", "FAIL"]},
            "findings_count": {"type": "integer"},
            "commit_tested": {"type": "string"}
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "skip",
      "profile": "product-owner",
      "type": "command",
      "command": "echo {\"status\": \"no code merge\"}",
      "body_template": "noop — skip QA"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {"from": "check-merge", "to": "qa-test", "condition": "${nodes.check-merge.output.should_test} == 'true'"},
    {"from": "check-merge", "to": "skip", "condition": "${nodes.check-merge.output.should_test} != 'true'"}
  ]
}
